{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：06:33 2026-11-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：06:33 2026-11-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：06:33 2026-11-23 HKT</p><img alt=\"荃灣大壩街鹹水管爆裂 水柱一度高近10米 行人路損毀滿布沙石。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3cbe25b68bdc834ef3124c912b026543/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_21_59_25.jpeg\"/><p>荃灣發生水管爆裂事故。今日（23日）凌晨5時許，大壩街23至25號對開一條鹹水管爆裂，有鹹水由行人路湧出，水柱一度高達約3層樓，現場交通一度受影響。</p><p>水務署職員接報到場並將水掣關上。現場所見，部分路面懷疑被水流沖刷損毀，遺下一個約1米乘1米的洞，路面上遺下大量沙石。</p><img alt=\"水務署人員到場將水掣關上。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de2331c1eef86f168178368f083194b6/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_21_57_19.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"荃灣大壩街有鹹水管爆裂。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1f73cd3fc6322d0d0829152f82dae723/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_21_57_20.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"水務署人員到場將水掣關上。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5eaa52a2f459f817931d413870996606/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_21_57_21.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"行人路上遺下一個1米乘1米的洞。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7561f606c46d51af68b9882ebfa86a55/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_21_57_22.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"行人路上遺下一個1米乘1米的洞。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/871b1953851e0571b6c52c7ce34d70cc/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_21_57_23.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"水柱一度高達近10米。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f0bf4fed945638ce8965340de1ed828/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_21_54_01.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T22:44:12.478184+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T22:33:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T01:57:26.120693+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T22:37:38.569613+00:00","content_hash":"1389c8842da84e7e360976029703ed84c67931275a1c1d475b0142cdfdb82dda","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_captur